  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Restoring Vision in Ethiopia within 20 Minutes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Too many people live in areas that have access to little or no eye care services. Unfortunately, without access to basic eye care, treatable eye infections like trachoma can cause people a lifetime of blindness. Trachoma is a painful bacterial eye infection that, if untreated, can rob individuals of their sight permanently. Supporting this project enables Orbis to perform surgeries reversing the impact of trachoma, and preserving vision and averting a lifetime of blindness.</narrative>
  </description>
